# Merkado Labs Safety

- This repository is the experimental Merkado Labs workspace for the Curaçao
  Merkado Direct (umbrella) and Merkado Pay (renter payment) demo. Listing
  scrapers live on merkado-cw. Merkado Direct · Rent Advance may remain as
  the internal series name.
- The only approved crypto implementation is the Optimism Mainnet transferable
  NFT flow (ADR-0008 / ADR-0010): one non-upgradeable ERC-721
  (`MerkadoRentOfferV1`) holding pooled native USDC rent per token id, backend
  mint, buyer pays the exact purchase price to the locked landlord payout
  address (NFT minter → buyer atomic), renter `depositRent` (exact monthly
  amount), and current-owner `claimRent`. The flow is implemented locally
  behind config — deployed but NOT activated or merged. Do not install a
  wallet/Safe SDK outside this approved flow.
- Contract funding, applying the chain store migration, hosted activation, and
  merging this PR each require explicit Product Lead approval. Uncontrolled
  real funds and production stay blocked.
- Product/architecture source of truth: `docs/00-docs-index.md` (`docs/01`–`12`); dashboard ops: `docs/12-deployment-runbook.md` + root `README.md`; safety narrative: `docs/08-security-and-privacy.md`. Detailed historical evidence is local-only under `docs/private/` (gitignored); do not commit it.
- Supabase operations may target only the approved Labs projects
  `ewoxmzznkavapcxdporm` and the isolated wave6 fork `ajbeqiwgpttpmzpqxepl`.
- Project reference `jkrfyvukhhsapoivntms` is production and is strictly forbidden.
- Never access or copy production data, users, schemas, secrets, credentials, or configuration.
- Never run destructive SQL without explicit user approval.
- Represent every database change in a reviewed migration file before applying it.
- Enable RLS on every table created in an exposed schema.
- Use service-role credentials only in local backend scripts; never commit, print, or expose them.
- Do not deploy to Vercel from this repository unless explicitly instructed.
- Do not add a new frontend surface, browser automation, AI framework, vector database, or
  knowledge-graph technology without an explicit task. The existing Labs dashboard is the
  approved demo surface.
- Stay focused on the Rent Advance demo and the requested scope.
